   "width": 3086,
   "height": 686
  },
  {
   "id": "6eca50fefd90742f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "沙羅",
   "x": 4894,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 580
  },
  {
   "id": "a19268416bb74cc2",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "第一張門票",
   "x": 7234,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "54446d7342cadeac",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "第二封信件",
   "x": 5674,
   "y": 187,
   "width": 1478,
   "height": 592
  },
  {
   "id": "f728a344dcb8e070",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "尼歌娜與達姬為何反常？",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 1502,
   "height": 1512
  },
  {
   "id": "d77fd7bd519e2317",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "尼歌娜",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 187,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 1418
  },
  {
   "id": "51bf28efe2999b05",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "米迦勒的真正目的？",
   "x": 2678,
   "y": 693,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 2158
  },
  {
   "id": "ca08367c299ad4af",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "誰向VPTS洩密？",
   "x": 3384,
   "y": 693,
   "width": 1088,
   "height": 2838
  },
  {
   "id": "6fb622ce7dd3e898",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "誰在監視公主？",
   "x": 1518,
   "y": 175,
   "width": 836,
   "height": 1064
  },
  {
   "id": "defd2731e6fc8580",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**音樂會現場**\n\n天城理人音樂會現場",
   "x": 2897,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "4c1d5a421b71251d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**孤兒院現場**\n\n廢棄孤兒院",
   "x": 3287,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "6402d76eceda0fe7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**改革保守矛盾**\n\n改革派與保守派矛盾",
   "x": 2386,
   "y": 1115,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "e0c20cb6c4527aca",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**彭達拉薩激化**\n\n彭達拉薩人的存在十分敏感，會激化人魚內部矛盾",
   "x": 2386,
   "y": 1515,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "7c3529ffe65fdb6c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**瓦解同盟**\n\n就算不至內戰也會瓦解同盟",
   "x": 2386,
   "y": 1939,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2290b1074b1e8ea8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**印度洋王國廢墟**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-沙羅與海都事件]]",
   "x": 9524,
   "y": 667,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "6030e4d84a6ee3d9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**印度洋公主誕生**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-沙羅與海都事件]]",
   "x": 9914,
   "y": 667,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "fc839a52f24a7eb5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**堂本薰是倖存者之一**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-米迦勒與V]]",
   "x": 10304,
   "y": 667,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "f86152a0b9309685",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**V是彭達拉薩人**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-米迦勒與V]]",
   "x": 8744,
   "y": 1103,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "aa1b44988baf1811",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**第二張門票**\n\n見 [[線索-DSL-綁架行動與VPTS]]",
   "x": 8744,
   "y": 667,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "9dd031ac33c1ced9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**經印度開櫃**\n\n必須經印度才能在時限內打開保險櫃，見 [[線索-DSL-綁架行動與VPTS]]",
   "x": 9134,
   "y": 655,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "22df593be1c7be21",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**孤兒院暗指**\n\n選擇孤兒院的理由：暗指人魚公主沒有父母，形同孤兒",
   "x": 8038,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d4d60716ab9e9307",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**火災三人倖存**\n\n29年前發生火災，案件紀錄3人倖存",
   "x": 8428,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "e650b9db679a14d1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "場景含意",
   "x": 4528,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "d0ee4e69d96af8ea",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**地下室APCS**\n\n地下室有APCS，導致未能提前發現沙羅",
   "x": 5308,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3ac26482a529bb25",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "手套",
   "x": 5308,
   "y": 703,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "8c9f6bfa7aeb0d06",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**V帶走沙羅**\n\nV前往海都城帶走沙羅",
   "x": 4918,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "3bff1fbdd6b2e883",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V知道海都城位置",
   "x": 4918,
   "y": 703,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2522a8ef4d3e9eb5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**座標海拔**\n\n座標、海拔",
   "x": 7258,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3e48fbf60bd225cf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "時間",
   "x": 7648,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3d6b964239b127bc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "以阿奎斯托語寫成",
   "x": 5698,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "8e07270ef4b19a02",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V懂得阿奎斯托語",
   "x": 5698,
   "y": 703,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "a6a24df9c26e75af",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "對象為前公主",
   "x": 6088,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2fcd87e61d787f9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V知道沙羅是前公主",
   "x": 6088,
   "y": 703,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d25a1979cd36c2f3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**地址保險箱**\n\n地址、行李保險箱編號、密碼",
   "x": 6478,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1a17e7d67d2be5a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**領取時限**\n\n4月6日0時0分後至4月7日0時0分前領取",
   "x": 6868,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "0c4a8fe054f7b7b6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**兩人理解他國**\n\n達姬與尼歌娜都大致理解其他王國的狀況",
   "x": 836,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "e0c132479e0bf104",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**尼歌娜管束達姬鼓勵**\n\n尼歌娜會管束公主，達姬則鼓勵公主享受",
   "x": 1226,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "422984b83a8f131f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**他國重視規矩**\n\n其他王國十分重視規矩，犯規會被嚴懲",
   "x": 446,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "42e8a6b866925d59",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**角色與閱歷不符**\n\n尼歌娜和達姬的角色與各自的身份閱歷不符，達姬理應比尼歌娜更清楚犯錯的後果以及帶來的外交問題",
   "x": 836,
   "y": 643,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 172,
   "color": "#DC2626"
  },
  {
   "id": "10fed45a21ac0061",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**基層卻知道監視者存在**\n\n明明只是基層，卻知道監視者的存在",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "0feacb046863d5db",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**暗中保護公主**\n\n暗中保護公主，並防止保守派抓到把柄",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 667,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "adc615550ee29e9c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**不利復興**\n\n不利米迦勒復興海之住民",
   "x": 3092,
   "y": 2339,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2e88307b4440c7d0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**有利綁架公主**\n\n有利米迦勒綁架人魚公主",
   "x": 2702,
   "y": 2339,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "43e0efd9c8ba07de",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**復興非真目的**\n\n復興不是米迦勒的真正目的",
   "x": 2860,
   "y": 2727,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "ae7d7afc6b4570d2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**塞雷亞知行蹤**\n\n塞雷亞清楚人魚公主行蹤",
   "x": 4188,
   "y": 2727,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "c0cdc071a1ebc568",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**塞雷亞明知合作**\n\n塞雷亞明知而同意合作，且刻意淡化問題",
   "x": 3445,
   "y": 1927,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "61ca95860e34ef71",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "與北太平洋立場矛盾",
   "x": 3482,
   "y": 2363,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f0f3db644ebfa861",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞與長老目標不同",
   "x": 3798,
   "y": 2751,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "26a4bb2e830d24f6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "北太平洋有意挑起爭端",
   "x": 3408,
   "y": 2751,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "3dffff398c39b824",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞向VPTS洩密",
   "x": 3993,
   "y": 3115,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2d247acea143c5ef",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "長老向VPTS洩密",
   "x": 3408,
   "y": 3115,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "0413deaf6fbf9f68",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "挑起內部爭端",
   "x": 3993,
   "y": 3455,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "56f1eb82f0f8e856",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**水妖掌握行蹤**\n\n水妖對人魚公主的行蹤有一定掌握，且從來不會在人魚公主忙碌時出現",
   "x": 1616,
   "y": 207,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "c541ec08d3c73c72",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**有人監視**\n\n有人密切監視人魚公主動向",
   "x": 1542,
   "y": 679,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "00350ca7861456cc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "保守派監視者",
   "x": 1932,
   "y": 703,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "99d82033c766089a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**多人監視**\n\n多人監視人魚公主",
   "x": 1737,
   "y": 1115,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
